---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="Prima Digital — web development studio building on CMS platforms, plugins, and SaaS.">
  <div class="about">
    <p class="lead">Prima Digital is a web development studio based in Vancouver. We build on CMS platforms, develop plugins, and are expanding into SaaS — this site is the process log for that last part.</p>

    <p>Building with AI tools is genuinely different from building client work. We're working out how to do it properly — the runbooks, the pre-build locks, the failure modes. That's what's here.</p>

    <p>If you're working through similar things or want to talk about the process, reach out to John or Dave — co-publishers of this.</p>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .about {
    max-width: 100%;
  }

  .about .lead {
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 400;
    color: var(--text);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about p {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: #888;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  .about a {
    color: var(--accent);
  }

  .about a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
